---
import { url } from '../../lib/url'
---

<section class="dw container" aria-labelledby="dw-title">
  <h2 id="dw-title">Desktop or web</h2>
  <div class="cols">
    <div>
      <h3>Desktop app</h3>
      <p>Install it on Windows, macOS or Linux. Your connections and secrets stay on your machine.</p>
      <p><a class="btn" href={url('/download/')}>Go to downloads</a></p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>In a browser</h3>
      <p>Run the studio with Docker and open it from any browser, for a team or a shared server.</p>
      <p><a class="btn" href={url('/docs/web-mode/')}>Read about web mode</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .dw {
    padding-block: 2.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .cols {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(18rem, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
  h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
  }
  p {
    color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>
